Would this be confint in library MASS you are talking about?  (Credit
where credit is due, and all that.)  If so, yes, it is expecting two or
more parameters, and a few drop=F's are needed if there is only one.

Reason: if you have just one parameter it is easy to just plot the profile
and read off all you might need.

