Australia                       http://www.marine.csiro.au 

********************************
Reply from Paul Eilers:

A simple trick to do circular smoothing with a linear
smoother is to repeat your data 3 or 5 times. Then smooth
linearly and cut out the middle part of the smooth
curve. 

