  Michael Ernst  :

I think this is what you want:

HERDS <- sample(298,size=50)
IND <- unlist(lapply(surf4$herd,function(x,y){any(x==y)},HERDS))
surf4[IND,]

This will give you all the observations from a sample of 50 herds.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Prof. Brian D. Ripley :

Something like

samp <- sample(unique(surf4$herd), 50)
surf4[match(surf4$herd, samp, 0) > 0, ]

will take a random sample of 50 herds, which is what I understand you
want.

