That line fits a glm model to the whole drill dataset. No wonder there is
no variation. Do read the manual page!

What do you think the bootstrap scenario should be here?  Are the x values
fixed or random?  See Davison & Hinkley's book for an extensive
discussion of how to apply the bootstrap to regression and other
structured problems.  If you intend to bootstrap residuals, you need to
create a new dataset to which to apply glm.

