>>From Steve Wofsy:
This could be a unix problem, either filling up the process table
(with defunct jobs, possibly), or else the priority has slipped to
zero (a problem with Splus' interaction with the unix nohup command
used in BATCH).  Check with ps -[options] when it has gotten slow.

