It's not too helpful to think in terms of residuals (which would not be a 
binomial distribution anyway).  Do something like:

n <- 500
x1 <- rnorm(n)
x2 <- runif(n)
logit <-  -1.5 + x1+2*x2
y <- ifelse(runif(n) < plogis(logit), 1, 0)

