From fharrell at virginia.edu  Thu Mar 23 02:36:22 2000
From: fharrell at virginia.edu (Frank E Harrell Jr)
Date: Wed, 22 Mar 2000 21:36:22 -0500
Subject: [S] Exact bootstrap distribution for Bernoulli sequence
Message-ID: <38D98325.52676F41@virginia.edu>

There is probably a basic reference for this which I've missed.  If you have a 
sample of Bernoulli random variables of size n for which s are observed ones 
and n-s are zero, and if you take a random sample with replacement of size n 
from this Bernoulli sequence, what is the exact distribution of the number of 
ones in this bootstrap sample, conditional on s?   Thanks -Frank

